  "job_B10.6.2_20251003_114251": {
    "text": "Lic, \u00f0e n\u00e6fre gystas on hus\u00e6rne onfo\u00f0, buton sellendlices gysthuses med \u00e6r apinsod sy, & \u00fe\u00e6t\nTo bodianne is eac swylce \u00fe\u00e6t geleaffulle wi\u00f0 mana\u00f0 warnien & fram \u00feam healice forh\u00e6bben,\nWe gehyrdon so\u00f0lice sume men lyt understandan \u00f0as scylde, & cwe\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t sumum gemete\nGyf hwylc so\u00f0lice, \u00feurhtogenum mana\u00fee o\u00fe\u00fee ahwylcre heafodlicre synne, ondr\u00e6dende\nTo secganne him is \u00fe\u00e6t hi eac swylce fram leasre cy\u00f0nesse hy forh\u00e6bben, wytende \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t\nWite hine eac swylce swa hwylc swa \u00f0is \u00feurhtyh\u00fe, o\u00f0\u00f0e swylcere d\u00e6dbote to afeormiane swa\n& to secganne him is \u00fe\u00e6t we ne cwe\u00fea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hit healic dysig sy, ac healic man \u00fe\u00e6t man for\nWitodlice \u00feonne he o\u00f0rum bi\u00f0 ge\u00feuht arf\u00e6st wuniende, & him selfum w\u00e6lhreow wuna\u00fe.\nWe myngia\u00fe eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge gearwe syn folc to l\u00e6ranne.\nSe \u00fee halige boc cunne, bodige halige boc; se \u00fee so\u00felice ne cunne, huru\u00feinga \u00fe\u00e6t cu\u00feost is he\nNan eornostlice hyne beladian m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6bbe tungan hwanon he m\u00e6ge \u00e6nigne getimbrian.\nSona so\u00felice swa he \u00e6nigne dweliendne gesih\u00fe, swa swa he m\u00e6ge, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00fereagende o\u00f0\u00f0e\n\u00deonne we so\u00felice Drihtne fultumiendum to sino\u00fee on an becuma\u00fe, wite anra gehwilc us to\nO\u00fe\u00fee gyf hwylc of belimpe ures fultumes behofa\u00f0, us mid so\u00fere lufe he myngie, & we mid\nMyngian ge sceolon geleaffulle \u00fe\u00e6t hi syngalnesse & gecneordnesse h\u00e6bben to gebiddanne.\n\u00de\u00e6t gemet so\u00f0lice to gebiddanne sceal swylc beon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rest ges\u00e6dum gebede \u00fe\u00e6t we credo\nGod, milde beo \u00feu me synfullum, & gefylle \u00fe\u00e6t drihtenlice gebed \u00fe\u00e6t we nemna\u00f0 pater noster.\nGif he eornostlice \u00fe\u00e6t rum & \u00feone \u00e6mtan h\u00e6bbe, \u00feonne bidde he \u00fea haligan apostolas &\nGif so\u00felice seo tid eal \u00feis to gefremmanne ungenihtsum beo, genihtsumie \u00fe\u00e6t an, \u00feu \u00f0e me\nGod, milde beo \u00f0u me synfullum, & pater noster mid geomrunge & heortan forbrytednesse.\n\u00c6lce d\u00e6g witodlice we sceolon Gode on urum gebede \u00e6ne o\u00fe\u00fee tuwa, butan hwa oftor m\u00e6ge,\nIc cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic andette ongean me unrihtwisnesse mine Drihtne, & \u00feu forgeafe arleasnysse synne\nGedonre andetnysse mid geomrunge & tearum Drihtne on gebede, to singanne is se fiftigo\u00f0a\nFor \u00feam seo andetnes \u00fee we m\u00e6ssepreostum do\u00f0 us fultum bring\u00f0, for \u00feam onfangenum\nSeo andetnes \u00fee we Gode sylfum do\u00f0 frama\u00f0 to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t, swa we urra synna gemyndigran\nGemun \u00feu hy so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t Dauid se witega cy\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he dyde, \u00feonne he cwy\u00f0, For \u00feam\nAndetnessa to syllane synt be eallum synnum \u00fee o\u00fe\u00fee on weorce o\u00fe\u00fee on ge\u00feance \u00f0urhtogene\nEahta synt frym\u00felice leahtras, buton \u00feam earfo\u00felice \u00e6nig m\u00e6g beon gemet.\n\u00deys hy sindon: se forma is gyfernis, \u00fe\u00e6t is wambe frecnes, o\u00feer forliger, \u00feridda asolcennes o\u00fe\u00fee\n\u00d0onne eornostlice hwa to scryfte cym\u00fe, he sceal beon ahsod geornlice hu o\u00fe\u00fee of hwylcum\nHe sceal beon l\u00e6red \u00fe\u00e6t he be \u00fewyrum ge\u00feohtum do his andetnesse.\nHim sceal eac swylce beon to ge\u00feeod \u00fe\u00e6t he be eahta frym\u00felican leahtrum do his andetnesse, &\nHingriende synt to gefyllanne, \u00feyrstende to drencanne, nacode to forhelianne, untrume & \u00fea \u00fee\nWitodlice \u00feas ealle eac swylce on him selfum gehwa sceal gastlice don, & an o\u00ferum fl\u00e6sclice\nSe \u00fee eornostlice gesih\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf Crist n\u00e6f\u00f0, \u00fee cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom hlaf lifiende \u00fee of heofonum\nSe \u00fee lare haliges Gastes & haligra boca flodum \u00feoliende by\u00f0, witodlice hine \u00feyrst; ac gif he\nSe \u00fee gesih\u00f0 hine sylfne rihtwisnesse o\u00fe\u00fee o\u00f0rum godra worca gegearwungum nacodne, & he\nGyf hwa on bedde hys leahtra li\u00fe, & of adle his unrihtwysness dyrf\u00fe, & mid rapum hys synna\nAc gyf he of bedde his leahtra \u00feurh andetnesse ut g\u00e6\u00fe, & \u00feurh d\u00e6dbote heofas of bendum his\nGyf he on \u00feyses lifes wege gesyh\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he dyrfe, & of leahtra ystum & swylce of sumre lyfte\n\u00d0a ealle \u00feonne he hy him selfum gastlice gegearwa\u00fe, Crist on him, \u00f0\u00e6s lim he is, he fede\u00fe &\nTo myngianne synt geleaffulle haligre Godes gesomnunge \u00fe\u00e6t hy hyra suna & dohtra l\u00e6ren \u00fe\u00e6t\nWitodlice eac \u00fea magas sceolon ymbe hyra bearn gemetf\u00e6stlice don, apostole cwe\u00feendum,\nWitodlice eac \u00fe\u00e6t him is to secganne \u00fe\u00e6t, gyf hy for gecyndlicre lufe arian willa\u00f0 on gyrdum\nTo myngianne is folc \u00fe\u00e6t hi undergyten \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t is so\u00f0 lufu \u00fe\u00e6t man God lufie swi\u00f0or \u00feonne hine\nWitodlice swa hwylce swa wena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0 lufu sy on \u00e6te & on w\u00e6te, o\u00fe\u00fee on o\u00ferum\nWitodlice eac \u00fea selfan, \u00feonne hie mid so\u00fere lufe beo\u00f0, hi beo\u00f0 gode & ongemang m\u00e6genu to\nTo mingianne synt \u00fea \u00fee manggungum & \u00feinga ceapungum onwacia\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t hie na swi\u00feor eor\u00f0lice\nWitodlice se \u00fee swi\u00feor be eor\u00f0licum \u00feingce \u00feonne be his sawle h\u00e6le \u00f0incg\u00fe, swi\u00f0e fram\nTo filgeanne is so\u00felice on \u00feison d\u00e6le, swa swa on o\u00ferum \u00feingum, seo apostollice spr\u00e6c, se\nSwa swa witodlice fram \u00feam \u00fee of geswincum \u00e6cera & o\u00ferum geswincum andlifene & scrud &\n\u00c6ghwylcum men God sealde cr\u00e6ft of \u00feam he fed by\u00fe, & anra gehwylc of his cr\u00e6fte \u00fee he his\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6restan ucan \u00e6r Lenctenes anginne andetnissa m\u00e6ssepreostum syndon to syllanne,\n& swa ingangende on eadiges Lenctenes tide cl\u00e6num & afeormodum modum to haligre Eastran\nSwa witodlice fulwiht, swa eac d\u00e6dbot synna dilga\u00fe.\n& for\u00feam \u00fee \u00e6fter fulwiht synful edniwan ne m\u00e6g beon fullod, \u00fees l\u00e6cedom d\u00e6dbote fram\n\u00de\u00e6t seofon gemetum synna beon forgifene halige bec gesweotolia\u00f0.\n\u00c6rest on fulwihte, \u00fe\u00e6t is for sinna forgifenisse geseald.\nO\u00fere si\u00fee \u00feurh martyrdom neah \u00feam \u00fee se sealmsangere cw\u00e6\u00fe, Eadig by\u00f0 se wer \u00fee him\n& neah \u00fe\u00e6s ylcan Dauides cwide \u00fe\u00e6t sinna beo\u00f0 \u00feurh fulwiht forgifene, & hy beo\u00f0 \u00feurh\n\u00deriddan si\u00f0e \u00feurh \u00e6lmessan, swa Daniel \u00feam awyrgedan cyninge Nabochodonosor s\u00e6de, Sinna\n& elleshw\u00e6r is gecweden, Weter acwenc\u00f0 byrnende fyr, & \u00e6lmesse acwenc\u00f0 sinne.\n& Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle, \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0re sylla\u00fe \u00e6lmessan, & efne nu ealle \u00feingc eow\nFeor\u00f0an si\u00fee, gif hwa forgif\u00f0 \u00feam \u00fee ongean hyne agilt, swa swa hit ger\u00e6dd is, Forgifa\u00fe & eow\n& eft F\u00e6der eower forgif\u00f0 eow eowre sinna, gif eowra anra gehwilc of his heortan forgif\u00f0.\nFiftan si\u00fee, gif \u00feurh eowre bodunge & godra worca bigenc hwilc o\u00feerne fram his gedwylde\nSixtan si\u00fee \u00feurh so\u00f0e lufu, neah \u00feam \u00fee hit awriten is, Godes sibb oferwrih\u00f0 sinna m\u00e6nigu \u00feurh\nEahto\u00f0an si\u00f0e \u00feurh d\u00e6dbote, neah \u00feam \u00fee Dauid cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic w\u00e6s gecirred on minre yrm\u00f0e \u00fea me\nSo\u00felice \u00fe\u00e6t Lengtenf\u00e6sten mid healicre begimene is to healdanne, \u00fe\u00e6t, buton Sunnandagum, \u00fea\nNe sy so\u00f0lice nan intinga on \u00feyssum dagum f\u00e6sten to abrecanne: for \u00f0am \u00f0e on o\u00ferum tidum is\nFor \u00feam on o\u00fere tide f\u00e6sten on selfes willan & dome \u00e6ghwylces is aset, on \u00feysum so\u00felice se \u00f0e\n& on o\u00fere tide se \u00fee f\u00e6st, he forh\u00e6fdnesse mede geearna\u00fe; on \u00feysum so\u00f0lice, buton seocum &\nF\u00e6stendagum so\u00f0lice \u00e6lmesse is to donne, & \u00feone mete o\u00fe\u00fee drinc \u00fee gehwa self brucan\nManega gewunia\u00f0 \u00fee wena\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6t hy f\u00e6sten, sona swa hy nonhringc gehyra\u00fe, \u00f0\u00e6t hy to \u00fe\u00e6re\nTo efstane is so\u00felice to m\u00e6ssan, & gehyredum m\u00e6ssan symlum & \u00e6fensangum, & \u00e6lmessum\nGyf so\u00felice hwylc mid neode gebunden sy, \u00fe\u00e6t he to m\u00e6ssan becuman ne m\u00e6ge, gewenedre\nForh\u00e6fdnes so\u00f0lice on \u00feysum dagum sceal beon forneah ealra esta, & syferlice & cl\u00e6nlice is to\nSe \u00f0e so\u00f0lice fram \u00e6grum & cyse & buteran & fixum & wine forhabban m\u00e6g, he is myceles\nSe \u00f0e witodlice fram \u00feam, for untrumnesse o\u00f0\u00f0e ahwylcum weorce, forhabban ne m\u00e6g, he bruce,\n\u00d0\u00e6t hwa fram cyse & meoluce & buteran & \u00e6grum forh\u00e6bbe, & ne f\u00e6ste, is gedwolenlicost &\nSo\u00felice wines & \u00e6lces w\u00e6tan druncennes & galnes synt forbodene, n\u00e6s meoluc & \u00e6gru.\nNe cw\u00e6\u00f0 witodlice se apostol, Nellen ge \u00feigcan meoluc & \u00e6gru, ac he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nellen ge beon\n\u00c6lc Sunnand\u00e6ge on Lencten Cristes lichaman & his blodes haligdomas syndon to onfonne,\nOn \u00feysum eowra f\u00e6stena dagum n\u00e6nige geflitu, n\u00e6nige saca sceolon beon h\u00e6fde, ac on Godes\nDrihten \u00feurh his witigan \u00f0rea\u00fe \u00fea \u00fee geflitu & saca on Lenctentyde bega\u00fe, & \u00fee wytu fram hyra\nEfne nu to geflitum & sacum ge f\u00e6sta\u00fe, & ge slea\u00fe of fyste arleaslice.\nTo forh\u00e6bbane is so\u00felice on \u00feysum haligostum dagum fram gem\u00e6ccum, & cl\u00e6nlice & arf\u00e6stlice\nTo myngianne is folc \u00fe\u00e6t hy to \u00f0am \u00feurhhaligum haligdome Drihtnes lichaman & blodes\nWitodlice swa swa is frecenfullic gehwylcne uncl\u00e6nne to swa m\u00e6rum haligdome geneal\u00e6cean,\nSo\u00felice fram eallum gewisre tide is to gem\u00e6nsumianne, buton \u00f0am swi\u00f0e \u00e6f\u00e6stum & haliglice\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00fea m\u00e6ssan \u00f0e gind Sunnandagas sindrie fram m\u00e6ssepreostum beo\u00f0, na swa in opennesse\nTo myngianne is folc \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00e6r openlicre & geendudre \u00feenunge to mete ne geneal\u00e6ce, & \u00fe\u00e6t\nAc o\u00fe\u00fee \u00f0a m\u00e6ssepreostas \u00f0e on \u00fe\u00e6re burge embehwyrfte o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00fe\u00e6re sylfan burg syndon,",
